                <pb facs="0593" n="523" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg523"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San
                                Francisco,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 29</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The report of the execution of Consul Carman by the French authorities at
                    Mazatlan, and the bombardment of the place by a United States gunboat, is news
                    here. Direct dates to January 18 say everything has been quiet since the city
                    was evacuated by the French last November.</p>
            </div>
